---
/* The two doors. Rendered under the hero and again at the close. */
---

<div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <article class="card flex flex-col">
    <h3 class="headline text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.375rem]">Shipping a self-serve product?</h3>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-normal">
      Signups that never become users. Teardowns, a two-week diagnostic from €4,500, a six-week
      rebuild.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-auto pt-6">
      <a
        class="font-[560] underline underline-offset-4"
        style="text-decoration-color: var(--accent)"
        href="/self-serve/">Self-serve →</a
      >
    </p>
  </article>
  <article class="card flex flex-col">
    <h3 class="headline text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.375rem]">
      Shipping a finance or insurance flow?
    </h3>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-normal">
      A quote, application or onboarding with a go-live date and no number on it. Two weeks, your
      tools, fixed price.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-auto pt-6">
      <a
        class="font-[560] underline underline-offset-4"
        style="text-decoration-color: var(--accent)"
        href="/finance-insurance/">Finance and insurance →</a
      >
    </p>
  </article>
</div>
